# procedural-chart
# Unit lookup: DUID to region and station, checked for coverage against the units that actually dispatched (#119).
direction: right
absent: no unit parquet
fetched: DISPATCHLOAD and DUDETAILSUMMARY parquet written
mapped: per-region units and cleared energy printed, coverage measured

absent -> fetched: "cmd: just nemosis-fetch DISPATCHLOAD \"2025/09/01 00:00:00\" \"2025/09/02 00:00:00\" && just nemosis-fetch DUDETAILSUMMARY \"2025/09/01 00:00:00\" \"2025/09/02 00:00:00\" | pass: each prints 'nemosis-fetch: <TABLE> rows=<N> sha256=<prefix>'"
fetched -> mapped: "cmd: just nem-unit-lookup | pass: prints a row per region then 'nem-unit-lookup: dispatched_duids=N mapped=M coverage=C' and 'PASS nem-unit-lookup' when coverage is at least 0.99"
